  {
   "id": "gunkid-99-116197@major-2019-03-22",
   "gameId": "gunkid-99-116197",
   "displayName": "Gunkid 99 - Shop Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-03-22T02:05:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this update I've finally implemented a feature that has been on my mind for some time now. And that is:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Selling Weapons you've bought back to the Shop",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As you already know, weapons from the Shop will start spawning in 'Normal' Mode once bought and unlocked. However, you might find yourself regretting the purchase but has no recourse to stop it from spawning other than equipping the equivalent Weapon-Blocker.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this update, any weapon sold back to the Shop will stop spawning in-game. Of course this only applies to weapons found in the Shop. Weapons you've naturally unlocked as you progress through the game cannot be sold!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now that there is no risk of being stuck with an undesired weapon, I hope this will incentivize some of you to give the various weapons in the Shop a try!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
